    {
      "id": "claim_1afbd7655ded49e08789f842cb86366e",
      "statement": "The Tailscale-based mobile connect path never changes the Hub's bind address from 127.0.0.1; tailscale serve proxies from the tailnet into that same loopback port, Tailscale Funnel (public internet exposure) is deliberately never used and the setup flow steers the user to leave it unchecked, and enabling serve idempotently adds the tailnet's own DNS name to hub.allowed_hosts so the Host/Origin guard and WebSocket handshake accept it.",
      "evidence": [
